!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Human Primary Effusion Lymphoma cell line BC-3
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: BC-3
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = modification 1: Lentivirally transduced SpCas9
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = modification 2: lentivirally transduceed Brunello sgRNA library
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = All compounds were dissolved in DMSO. cells were treated with either 5uM Lenalidomide, 1uM Pomalidomide, 1uM CC-122 or corresponding volume of DMSO. Media was changed and fresh drug was added every two days.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Clonal Cas9 expressing BC-3 cells were grown in RPMI + 20% Serum Plus II (Sigma Aldrich) at concentration ranging from 3X10^5 to 9X10^5 cells/ml. The Brunello library was transduced at an MOI of 0.3. 1ug/ml Puromycin was used to select after library transduction
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cells pelleted, washed twice with sterile cold PBS and flah frozen in an ethanol-dry ice bath before storing at -80C. gDNA was harvested from frozen cell pellets by following the gDNA extraction protocol mentioned in Manzano et al., Nature Communications, 2018.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Protocol followed for PCR amplification and barcoding of sgRNA inserts is mentioned in Manzano et al., Nature Communications 2018.
!Sample_description = lentivirally integrated sgRNA casette amplified from gDNA
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: CRISPR screen
!Sample_data_processing = The 5′ and 3′ adapter sequences were removed from demultiplexed sequencing reads
!Sample_data_processing = Remaining reads were aligned to the Brunello CRISPR library file using Bowtie
!Sample_data_processing = The number of reads per sgRNA were counted and summarized in a read count table
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: .txt with read count
!Sample_platform_id = GPL20301
